                "jpn": null
            },
            "Summaries": {
                "eng": "The story follows Dongdong, a passionate gamer and top-tier player of the popular VRMMORPG “Azure World.” After years of dedication, he suddenly finds himself mysteriously transported inside the game — but not as his strong hero avatar. Instead, he wakes up as a low-level skeleton monster, one of the weakest creatures in the world!\r\nNow stuck in this bizarre situation, Dongdong has to adapt to life as a monster and survive in a world filled with powerful adventurers who would happily destroy him for experience points.",
                "jpn": null
            },
